  "notes": "Exact uniform-tile comparison avoids reading the PSRAM baseline for certified solid-color tiles. Partial updates invalidate certificates; all rendered pixels, transfer decisions, animation cadence, sensor behavior and radio admission stay unchanged.\n\nAll 45 focused host suites passed after updating the strip harness to retain patterned and uniform pixel cases. Checked build, actual ELF/map I2C-chain audit and exact USB write passed; Twin reconnected and all 64 flashlight learning rows were preserved.\n\nA matched 16-sample Desktop observation measured scan median 2.79 ms versus 3.80 ms (-26.47%). Smoothed FPS median was 53.60 versus 52.65. This is a bounded improvement, not a stable 60 FPS or all-screen claim. Full-copy certification cost and remaining IR/NTC/fixture and physical-phone QA limits stay open.",
